{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 5 från C.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 5 by C.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Integration measures", "dok_titel": "Integration", "forslag_text": "The Riksdag rejects the motions \n\n2024/25:1719 by Jamal El-Haj (-) motions 1-3, 5 and 6, \n\n2024/25:1799 by Eva Lindh et al. (S), \n\n2024/25:2628 by Leila Ali Elmi et al. (MP) motion 10, \n\n2024/25:2949 by Jonny Cato et al. (C) motion 27 and \n\n2024/25:3072 by Ardalan Shekarabi et al. (S) motion 7.", "notis": "The Riksdag rejected approximately 30 proposals about integration in motions from the general motion period 2024. The proposals deal with, among other things, the settlement law (bosättningslagen), the target group for the integration programme, integration measures and social exclusion. The Riksdag refers to ongoing work.", "alternatives": ["The Riksdag rejects the motions \n\n2024/25:1719 by Jamal El-Haj (-) motions 1-3, 5 and 6, \n\n2024/25:1799 by Eva Lindh et al. (S), \n\n2024/25:2628 by Leila Ali Elmi et al. (MP) motion 10, \n\n2024/25:2949 by Jonny Cato et al. (C) motion 27 and \n\n2024/25:3072 by Ardalan Shekarabi et al. (S) motion 7.", "Reservation 5"]}, "votering_id": "B63FC8CC-C9CC-416B-AE07-9FAA824F0E94", "rm": "2024/25", "beteckning": "AU5", "punkt": 4, "dok_id": "HC01AU5", "datum": "2025-02-19", "utskott": "AU", "rubrik": "Etableringsinsatserna", "dok_titel": "Integration", "sammanfattning": "Arbetsmarknadsutskottet föreslår att riksdagen säger nej till cirka 30 förslag om integration i motioner från den allmänna motionstiden 2024.\nFörslagen handlar b